{"id":"6e777315ba944342","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-fodor-failure.md","title":"Failure of Pressing Down at a Singular Cardinal","display":"thm-fodor-failure — Failure of Pressing Down at a Singular Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-fodor-failure","aliases":["58-thm-fodor-failure"],"display":"thm-fodor-failure — Failure of Pressing Down at a Singular Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-fodor-failure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-fodor-failure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fodor-failure — Failure of Pressing Down at a Singular Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,f,C,\\xi\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,S,f,C,\\xi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\)</span>（奇异基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\)</span>（退缩函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\)</span>（闭无界集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>）</li>\n<li>在奇异 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 上，“平稳”按与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-club 相交定义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fodor\\text{-}failure}\\vdash \\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\;\\Biggl[\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land C\\cap\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\xi\\}=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fodor\\text{-}failure}\\vdash \\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\;\\Biggl[\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land C\\cap\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\xi\\}=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>断言给出一个平稳域上的退缩函数，而每个常值纤维都非平稳，因此 pressing-down 结论失败。</li>\n<li>取一条长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> 的共尾序列并按首次越过的区间着色即可构造这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；不需要额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)&gt;\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)&gt;\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>规范 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a> 把正则性写入谓词，故这里显式展开奇异基数上的广义平稳性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)$（奇异基数谓词，见 [[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)$（退缩函数谓词，见 [[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)$（闭无界集谓词，见 [[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"规范 [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]] 把正则性写入谓词，故这里显式展开奇异基数上的广义平稳性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,S,f,C,\\xi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fodor\\text{-}failure}\\vdash \\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\;\\Biggl[\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\land\\forall\\xi<\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land C\\cap\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\xi\\}=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)>\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1691,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-fodor-failure.md|58-thm-fodor-failure]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","02120307ea943054","04670bdc8b64b8dd","b802c3dd76418d95"]}